<div class="detail-card prose">
  <h1>Keeping your account safe</h1>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Use a long password.</strong> At least 15 characters. A short sentence you can remember works well.</li>
    <li><strong>Don't reuse passwords.</strong> If another website is hacked, your SecureBook account stays safe.</li>
    <li><strong>Check the padlock.</strong> Only log in when the address starts with https:// and shows a padlock.</li>
    <li><strong>Watch out for fake messages.</strong> SecureBook will never ask for your password by email, SMS or WhatsApp.</li>
    <li><strong>Log out on shared computers.</strong> You are also logged out automatically after 15 minutes of inactivity.</li>
    <li><strong>Locked out?</strong> After 5 wrong passwords your account is locked for 15 minutes to stop guessing attacks.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted">See also our <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.</p>
</div>

